# _TRIGGERDEMO_LINEUP_AND_ROLL.scn -- snap EXACTLY onto the real RWY 35R
# centerline/heading (same MOVE used by _TRIGGERDEMO_STOP_HOLD for aircraft
# that actually hold), then immediately roll -- for the FIRST departure,
# which has nobody to wait for and so never went through STOP_HOLD. Without
# this exact lineup, the aircraft begins its climb-out route from whatever
# position/heading the taxi ADDWPT chain happened to leave it at, which is
# not guaranteed to be precisely on the runway centerline/true heading.
# Call: PCALL _TRIGGERDEMO_LINEUP_AND_ROLL <acid> <lat> <lon> <hdg>
00:00:00.00>%0 LNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>%0 VNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>MOVE %0,%1,%2,0,%3,0.0
00:00:00.00>PCALL _TRIGGERDEMO_DEP_ROLL %0
